& [Fault]
  + the first exact workspace debug gate ran before transitive current-manifest refresh and nineteen static evidence targets refused the changed crates/cantor_ecosystem/src/lib.rs identity

& [Containment]
  + Cargo used no-fail-fast and preserved the explicit stale-evidence diagnostics; executing semantic targets continued without a reported behavior failure
  + no provider request remote call permit runner invocation or effect occurred

& [Resolution]
  + return the implementation manifest exact-workspace flag to false refresh only mutable transitive manifests in dependency order verify zero stale references then rerun the full exact gate

& [Lesson]
  + repository-wide static evidence targets must follow the governed transitive rehash step whenever a commonly referenced source file changes
